  "bio": "Agliolo is a masterful tattoo artist based in Wetzikon, Switzerland, specializing in the intricate and meticulous art forms of black & gray and dotwork tattoos. Their attention to detail and precision in every design ensures that each client leaves with a stunning piece of art. Coupled with top-notch cleanliness standards in their studio, Agliolo not only delivers exceptional tattoos but also maintains a sterile and safe environment for all clients.\nPrice: $\nCurrent location: Wetzikon, Zurich, Switzerland\n\nAgliolo Tattoo\nRealistic Tattoo Artist 🇮🇹 🇨🇭\nEmail:agliolotattoo@gmail.com\n076 438 31 47",
